alue":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":180},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Define an execution budget covering matching and replacement and document its host/runtime semantics; A pathological caller-selected pattern cannot monopolize the SDK host event loop and timeout refuses before history/item writes or locks; Preserve supported JavaScript regex flags and replacement behavior with Node and Bun coverage; Retain bounded isolated-process negative controls for pathological existing and leading-slash forms plus a normal-pattern control"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-qwoy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"SDK embeddings can apply trusted regex redaction with predictable resource bounds and truthful no-write timeout recovery."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1689","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-09T13:58:39.780Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-oz8u","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-09T13:58:39.780Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-xk39","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-09T13:58:39.780Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-09T13:58:39.780Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check: live regex timeout/redaction and history-redaction searches found the existing audited-redaction lineage and completed wildcard matcher work but no open history regex execution-budget owner. An isolated one-second probe timed out equally for the existing escaped form and the new leading-slash spelling; the linear control completed. This is a pre-existing trusted-caller resource-bound enhancement and is not claimed implemented or a newly confirmed vulnerability."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"d5b32cffd8e5f74dc5e8bad9e233f9e2812258b90198f0cafdcdd8b274f3e885","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"fc63200f1902aaf96f7297b3618174a47738c30a9482b364a6df00738414d1c4"}
